###  http://voparis-ns.obspm.fr/rdf/ihdea/refframe/IPHIO
:IPHIO rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                :IoCenteredFrame ,
                :PhiOmegaFrame ;
       rdfs:comment """In this Cartesian coordinate system, X is along the flow direction, Y is along
the Io-Jupiter vector, and Z is along the spin axis.

These coordinates are analogous to the earth-centered GSE coordinates that relate to the direction
of flow of the solar wind onto Earth's environment.""" ;
       rdfs:label "Io Phi-Omega" ;
       rdfs:seeAlso :GSE .


