:KSM rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
              :SaturnCenteredFrame ;
     rdfs:comment """A coordinate system where the X axis is from Saturn to Sun, Z axis is northward in
a plane containing the X axis and the Kronian dipole axis.

NB: Some sources refers magnetic dipole at 180 degrees longitude, 89.99 degrees latitude in the
#IAU_SATURN frame. Other source make assume that the dipole axis is parallel to the spin axis.""" ;
     rdfs:label "Kronian Solar Magnetospheric" .


###  http://voparis-ns.obspm.fr/rdf/ihdea/refframe/KSO
:KSO rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
