 -  The inertially referenced velocity of the Sun relative to Saturn is the secondary vector: +Y axis is the
    component of this velocity vector orthogonal to the +X axis;
 -  +Z axis completes the right-handed system;
 -  the origin of this frame is Saturn center of mass.
    """ ;
